[2026-10-21] XAMPP for Windows multi-version 8.4.27-0
This version of XAMPP contains the following software releases:
   - Apache 2.4.65
   - MariaDB 10.11.16 (default)
   - MariaDB 11.8.9
   - OpenSSL 3.5.1
   - PHP 8.2.35
   - PHP 8.3.30
   - PHP 8.4.27 (default)
   - PHP 8.5.5
   - phpMyAdmin 5.2.3
   - Tomcat 8.5.99
   - curl 8.19.0

All PHP and MariaDB versions are installed side by side under
xampp\php-versions and xampp\mysql-versions. xampp\php and xampp\mysql are
directory junctions to the active versions; use xampp-switch.bat to change
them (for example "xampp-switch php 8.3" or "xampp-switch mysql 11.8").
Each MariaDB version keeps its own data directory.

